OL,3,GNEWSAHow will next phase of major
OL,4,Aroadworks affect you?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe next phase of roadworks that are
OL,7,Fpart of the biggest upgrade of a water
OL,8,Fnetwork in 150 years will begin next
OL,9,Fweek.
OL,11,FThames Water is closing Barkham Road
OL,12,Fbetween the Bearwood Road roundabout
OL,13,Fand the Barkham Street roundabout from
OL,14,Fnext Monday until 13 November.
OL,16,FIt is the latest phase of major mains
OL,17,Freplacement work in Arborfield, with
OL,18,Fclosures and diversions on Barkham Road
OL,19,Fcontinuing in phases until the end of
OL,20,FJune 2027.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
